                        "sense_id": "e1632e0f-a342-301b-a089-3a1257e32713",
                        "entry_id": "456b1ee1-688f-3b44-90ad-e9b8ae678f36",
                        "glosses": [
                            "persistence, tenaciousness"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb0ba2be-bfaf-40d3-ae70-de6dae5fd0eb",
                                "sense_id": "e1632e0f-a342-301b-a089-3a1257e32713",
                                "text": "Пьер не име́л той практи́ческой це́пкости, кото́рая бы дала́ ему́ возмо́жность непосре́дственно взя́ться за де́ло, и потому́ он не люби́л его́ и то́лько стара́лся притвори́ться пе́ред управля́ющим, что он за́нят де́лом.",
                                "translation": "Pierre had none of the practical persistence that would have enabled him to attend to the business himself and so he disliked it and only tried to pretend to the steward that he was attending to it.",
                                "english": "Pierre had none of the practical persistence that would have enabled him to attend to the business himself and so he disliked it and only tried to pretend to the steward that he was attending to it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
